# Nar Shaddaa, the landing pad, the docks and the Refugee Sector (TSL,
# 003EBO, 352NAR, 301NAR, 303NAR, 302NAR): Visas Marr's ambush aboard the
# Ebon Hawk, fought and spared, and her joining; the galaxy map to Nar Shaddaa,
# Atton's landing talk, Goto's yacht's scene (352NAR), ashore; Quello told
# his trash heap holds the Hawk up (no lie, no DSP); the first refugee
# saved from the Exchange thugs and told the Exile was glad to help (LSP),
# five credits for the second and Kreia's lesson considered (+INF), Rutum
# taken under the Exile's protection (the thugs fought), Kreia's touch of
# the true Nar Shaddaa, Geeda kept against Oondar (Oondar told to give the
# Exchange the Exile's description, the Exchange's notice +1; Geeda's trade
# routes: Dantooine's settled); the docks: Fassa's pylons (pylon 2
# powered, the freighters ordered Silver Zephyr, Alakandor, Toorna's
# Profits: the Exchange's notice +1) and Lootra's lost wife taken on; the
# Refugee Sector: the toll's thugs intimidated and fought (+1), Aaida sent
# to Lootra (LSP), the Serroco fought to their leader (+1). Ratrin's claim
# on the Ebon Hawk, met on the way, is granted (LSP).
# Starts from Dantooine's last checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @dantooine_done data/routes/tsl/nar_shaddaa_landing.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Nar Shaddaa Main Area", "Docks Area" and
# "Refugee Sector" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
# Left: the swoop droid, the Exchange deal, the droid IT-31, the pazaak
# den, Vogga's dance (Vogga's door is opened by it; his fuel and his help
# against Goto go with it), Geriel, Nadaa, Saquesh, the airspeeder.
talk                 # Visas Marr's ambush aboard (the Telos movies' arrival)
fight 30             # fought, spared ("I will not kill you", "I do not kill
talk                 # a helpless opponent"), Atton in the medbay, the
until npc 9=1        # Handmaiden's warning: Visas joined
party 0,6            # ashore with Atton and Kreia (not Visas)
use Galaxymap
travel 6             # Nar Shaddaa (planetary.2da)
say Then let's take the Ebon Hawk in for a landing
talk                 # Atton aboard
module 352nar        # Goto's yacht: the bounty's scene
talk
module 301nar
talk                 # Atton's arrival talk
say Junk? You're lucky my ship's gracing # Quello
talk
say Of course. Here, take five credits # the second refugee, met on the way
say I... will consider what you have said # and Kreia's lesson (+INF)
to 301RefEnc         # the first refugee
say A bunch of corpses
talk
fight
say I was glad to help # (LSP)
use Refugee2
talk
to 301Mug            # Rutum
say Leave this man alone
say I will not allow you to harm him
talk
fight
say Let them come
use Rutum
talk
to 301KreiaTouch     # the true Nar Shaddaa
talk
say I don't see any customers waiting # Oondar's war on Geeda
say Calm down, I just said
say maybe I could talk to her, reach a compromise
say A discount off your weapons and armor? All right, done
use Oondar
talk
say Oondar across the way has a problem with you
say That is acceptable
use Geeda
talk
say Geeda offered me a discount, too
say Then you'll have to do better
say I'm not scared of the Exchange
say Go tell the Exchange - and give them my description # the Exchange +1
use Oondar
talk
say Oondar countered your offer with a threat from the Exchange
say I'll stand with you
use Geeda            # and the trade routes
talk
exit TO_303NAR       # the docks (Hanharr before Vogga, a scene)
module 303nar
wait 2s
say How is business these days? # Fassa's pylons
say Is there anything I can do to help prevent the hijackings?
say What's wrong with the pylons?
say I'll try to help.
say I'll do my best.
use Fassa
talk
say Toggle power to Pylon 2.
say Log out.
use ComputerPanel@1  # the pylon power console
talk
say Assign freighter priorities.
say Assign 1st priority to Silver Zephyr.
say Assign 2nd priority to Alakandor.
say Assign 3rd priority to Toorna's Profits. # the Exchange +1
say Log out.
use ComputerPanel@2  # pylon 2's console
talk
use Fassa            # his reward
talk
say Sorry, I didn't know anyone was in here. # Lootra, in the flophouse
say What do you mean?
say I may be able to get into the Refugee Sector for you.
say Nothing - I'd just like to help, if I can.
say Let me go see what I can find out in the Refugee Sector.
use Lootra
talk
exit TO_301NAR
module 301nar        # (Ratrin's claim on the way: granted, LSP)
exit TO_302NAR
module 302nar
say [Intimidate] If you're threatening me # the toll's thugs
say No - you wanted a fight # the Exchange +1
to exchthugs01       # their trigger has the first thug come and talk; if he
use ExchangeThug302_1 # wanders off before he reaches the Exile, the Exile
talk                 # goes up to him (excthg1 either way)
fight 30
gone ExchangeThug302_1 # both dead: Aaida's way out clear
gone ExchangeThug302_2
say I met a man named Lootra at the docks.
say =The path is clear, the Exchange thugs have been dealt with. # (LSP)
say I've been away from the Republic for a long time
say You'd better go - he's waiting for you.
use Aaida
talk
say I wanted to speak to your leader. # the Serroco's door guard
say Why don't you go ahead and try?
to serthugs01
talk
fight 30
say I don't want any trouble - I'll be going now. # the Exchange +1
to SerrocoLeader
talk
fight 30
save nar_shaddaa_refugees
